This is important. The review action has several gates:

1. `_check_review_authority` (#546): current cwd must have an ouyangfeng registered instance.
2. `_check_review_record` (F-035): The task file must already have a non-empty `## 终审记录` section, OR `--review-file` path specified.
3. `_check_negative_claims` (F-035): if opinion contains negative assertion words, must have `**存在性核查**` anchor.
4. `_check_issue_disposition` (F-036): if 发现问题 section contains 🟠/🟡 items, must note disposition.

So before running `review`, I need to write the `## 终审记录` section into the task file (with my verdict, blocking, residual_risks, 存在性核查, 独立验证, scores). This is the "审查意见书落盘" which is my allowed exit action.

